# JOURNEY · selling: a fish the player owns leaves the tank for cash.
# The sell list opens on the game's starting stock (Coffee, Bait, Necronomicon); the fish is below it.

clear
include scenes/buy-a-fish.play Merluza Ann
run /shop
key down
key enter
expect Ann (Merluza)
select Ann (Merluza)
key enter
expect Sell Ann for $
snap the sale is confirmed before anything is lost
key enter
absent Ann (Merluza)
snap the fish is gone from the sell list
key esc
key esc
absent Sell

run /index
absent Ann
